	  	                  Megadeth
				 Youthansia.			

Tabbed By Mat. 21st November 1994.

Note: And now by popular request...

Notation:       h = Hammer;	p = Pull;	. = Palmute
		\ = Slide down;	/ = Slide up;	b = bend to note
                x = Palmute whilst muffling strings with left hand.
                tr= Trill.

Tempo approx. 100 4/4.

